      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE WE GO (3) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 10 lengths away in fifth (30.81). Was in the money the start prior. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Ready to return to form. HELLO PECK (8) ran below his best last time finishing fourth (29.71) over 515m at this track in a NG. Has a strong record here including four wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. FASCINATE JOHN (2) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in second (29.60) behind Shadow Assassin at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Deserves a win and gets his chance. ETHANOL SECRET (5) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
